{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4fab80e5663e53ca86539ee4f923f6040cfdb07c43161a8bc21012ccdf8ef1fb","ja":"ふふっ、●●●●プロデューサーさんとなら\nゲームも楽しくできそうだよね♪","zh":"呵呵，要是和●●●●制作人一起玩，\n游戏好像也能变得很有趣呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9617795841be7c9e4232062778954e30f8533a322beb0d7dc17c4ac5d01dd459","ja":"確かに……そうですよね！","zh":"确实……是这样呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8b43502a1c4dc0896d757d5257bbf4e2a1e7722dad13bb5cd300233a6b8082f0","ja":"私、●●●●プロデューサーさんをさっそく\nオンラインゲームに招待してみます！　それじゃあ！","zh":"我马上就去邀请●●●●制作人\n来玩联机游戏！先这样啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e9f895cc6c302990da0b5abbadb45661a713d8e50119b72ba9a7f55287533763","ja":"えっ、今から？\n……って、もう行っちゃった……。","zh":"咦，现在就去？\n……等等，已经走掉了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5fce242ea67bd328729590fb3e587a496c5d3c6f8bb44e58243c001e1aa5ab9b","ja":"百合子さん、もっとゲームで\nよふかししちゃうかもしれないですね？","zh":"百合子可能会因为玩游戏\n而熬得更晚呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"457c71eb51f8c70df9e7c1f74c22643abc4014c43bfac4b7ab47451ac19b1221","ja":"そうですね～。ですがとても楽しそうでしたし、\n少しくらいならいいのではないでしょうか～。","zh":"也是呢～。不过看起来真的很开心，\n稍微来一点的话应该没关系吧～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481","ja":"翌日……","zh":"隔天……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"55d81ef5671d93466b40beb9acd65204a0582136d81d5a646614d2c11f198c85","ja":"あら、百合子さん。\nなんだかとってもお急ぎのようですね～？","zh":"哎呀，百合子。\n看起来好像很着急呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"8cb625e106f57e94a1b5ad74532860ef1176c65da09155a04fb2e495f40b8211","ja":"はい！　●●●●プロデューサーさんと\nゲームできることになったんです♪","zh":"是的！能和●●●●制作人一起\n玩游戏了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"a7a35e21c25ecf351a02d3c18a0100b9de29afe7b7c9de987a0ea2a11fc160ca","ja":"開始直後は説明することが多くって……。\nだから今日は、早めに失礼しますね！","zh":"刚开始的时候要说明的事情比较多……\n所以今天我就先告辞啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"6b0d136b1c658a0f372852a7610549d7ecd5471972a7750cfd272fb8ae5d7c4e","ja":"翌々日……","zh":"大后天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"614c83f2feaa6dcf586a40550aa282cdd0d7e605b0d61e6b0724ef39c763f007","ja":"百合子ちゃん、今日も●●●●プロデューサーさんと\nオンラインゲーム？","zh":"百合子，今天也和●●●●制作人\n玩联机游戏吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"473c2b3ae256cf02344c545c2cd1acda331a4dab1d7156d0ff4cef2530622e93","ja":"はい！　チュートリアルのステージはクリア\nできたので、今日から本格的に冒険を始めるんです！","zh":"好！新手教程的关卡已经顺利通关，\n所以从今天起要正式开始冒险了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"c01a2f66ae00fbc727108352397e7b5a069a4cec72deb2dfa428ab335c81257a","ja":"ふふ♪　すっごく楽しそうだね！","zh":"呵呵♪　看起来超级开心呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1015.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"e0d5d19b55aca42191f1c1547cb0d8f8002aa58fc3883aa4a332f548bf18720b","ja":"はいっ！　もう楽しくて楽しくて……。\nそれじゃあ、お先に失礼しますっ！","zh":"好的！真的很开心很开心……\n那我先告辞了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
